@startuml
title CV Upload and AI Parsing - Sequence Diagram
actor Candidate
participant WebApp
participant Gateway
participant Storage
participant CvService
queue Queue
participant Worker
participant AI
database PostgreSQL
Candidate -> WebApp : upload CV file
WebApp -> Gateway : multipart upload
Gateway -> Storage : save file
Gateway -> CvService : create CV metadata (PENDING)
CvService -> PostgreSQL : insert CandidateCV
Gateway -> Queue : enqueue CV_PARSE job
Queue -> Worker : processCvParseJob
Worker -> Storage : download file
Worker -> AI : extract text + structured data
Worker -> PostgreSQL : update parsed data, search text, status
Worker --> WebApp : status becomes completed (poll/reload)
@enduml